    {
      "brand": "Deep Sea",
      "model": "DSE7120",
      "text": "DSE7120",
      "line": "All gensets are supplied complete with DSE7120/DSE7320 control panel, battery charger, appropriately sized ABB circuit breaker, steel welded baseframe with minimum 8 hour fuel tank, AVMs, batteries, silencers, flex and all other standard accessories so that your genset is ready for use. All you need to add is fuel, oil and coolant.",
      "src": [
        2001
      ]
    },
    {
      "brand": "Deep Sea",
      "model": "DSE7220",
      "text": "DSE7220",
      "line": "All of our gensets come as standard supplied with a Deep Sea DSE7120 or DSE7220 control panel along with a Deep Sea battery charger and an appropriately sized ABB circuit breaker. Deep Sea Electronics is one of the world’s top manufacturers of generator control and battery charger equipment. All of our control panels are made in the UK and are of excellent quality.",
      "src": [
        2005
      ]
    },
    {
      "brand": "Deep Sea",
      "model": "DSE3110",
      "text": "DSE3110",
